OL,3,GNEWSABillie Piper to star in new horror
OL,4,Aset on 'outskirts of old Welsh iron
OL,5,Atown'
OL,6,
OL,7,FActor Billie Piper is set to star in a
OL,8,Fnew supernatural horror filmed on the
OL,9,F"outskirts of an old iron town" in
OL,10,FWales.
OL,12,FLocated "somewhere on the perimeter" of
OL,13,FMerthyr Tydfil or Aberdare, Sketchbook
OL,14,Fwill feature Piper, alongside child
OL,15,Factor Woody Norman, as a mother and son
OL,16,Fwho are reunited after years apart in
OL,17,Ffoster care.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
