OL,3,GNEWSABillie Piper to star in new horror
OL,4,Aset on 'outskirts of old Welsh iron
OL,5,Atown'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt will be directed by Swansea-born
OL,8,Ffilmmaker Jamie Jones, who hopes the
OL,9,Ffilm will tap into "important and real
OL,10,Fissues" while still providing the
OL,11,Fthrill of a horror.
OL,13,F"I think a lot of people will relate to
OL,14,Fthe issues, of growing up and social
OL,15,Fexclusion, going on beneath it all -
OL,16,Fbut on the surface it's a really
OL,17,Fexciting horror film," he said.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
